  "difficulty_reason": "The author realizes the category through modules over the endomorphism ring of a possibly nonprojective generator. The main difficulty is proving the counit injective from finite-generator tests and then proving exactness of the left adjoint using AB5 and finite free submodules; this is a substantive structural theorem beyond qualification category or homological algebra.",
